em-induced distortion in visual perception</article-title><source>Ann Pharmacother</source><year>2003</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>683</fpage><lpage>686</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12708947</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B9"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Zisser</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Rivera</surname><given-names>SC</given-names></name><name><surname>Lane</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><article-title>Zolpidem-induced sleep-eating resulting in significant hyperglycemia in a subject with type 1 diabetes discovered via continuous glucose monitoring</article-title><source>Clin Diabetes</source><year>2013</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>133</fpage><lpage>135</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.2337/diaclin.31.3.133</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B10"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Harrison</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Keating</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><article-title>Zolpidem</article-title><source>CNS Drugs</source><year>2005</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>65</fpage><lpage>89</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.2165/00023210-200519010-00008</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15651908</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B11"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Ansseau</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Pitchot</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Hansenne</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Gonzalez Moreno</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><article-title>Psychotic reactions to zolpidem</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>1992</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>809</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1347827</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B12"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Iruela</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Ibanez-Rojo</surn